@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title REVIEW 2026-10-26 - Containers (MySQL 8.0.46)
rectangle "External CSKH / Report clients" as C
rectangle "External Keycloak IdP" as I
rectangle "TelecomManagement system" {
 rectangle "Spring Boot / Java 21\nModular monolith API\nRenewal worker + JOB01/JOB02 + activation recovery" as A
 database "MySQL 8.0.46 / InnoDB\nAuthoritative business data\nREAD COMMITTED writes / UTC" as D
 queue "RabbitMQ\nInventory wakeup only" as M
 database "Redis\nCatalog read cache" as K
}
rectangle "k6 + independent reconciler" as X
C --> A : REST / verified JWT
I ..> A : JWKS / issuer / audience / scopes
A --> D : transaction / locks / constraints
A --> M : publish after stock commit
M --> A : duplicate-safe wakeup
A --> K : cache-aside / invalidate / fallback DB
X --> A : mixed external logical requests
X --> D : controlled seed / read reconciliation
note bottom of A
RecordedAt is business time in a committed transaction.
Renewal cadence is reviewed separately from UC01 recovery.
MySQL owns money, allocation, lifecycle and request outcomes.
end note
@enduml
